# Alternative configuration for run set C (PERF-08). Sourced by perf/run_pipeline.sh after ref.env.
# Change exactly ONE software setting, chosen from run-set-B evidence (e.g. shuffle partitions, file format
# or join strategy). Keep hardware, EMR release, replication and storage identical to ref.
# Record the choice and the evidence for it in docs/decisions/decision-log.md before running set C.
# run_pipeline.sh refuses --config alt while CONFIG_NOTE is empty.
CONFIG_NOTE=""
# Example (do not uncomment without evidence):
# CONFIG_NOTE="alternative: spark.sql.shuffle.partitions=16 (default 200), everything else as ref"
# SPARK_OPTS="$SPARK_OPTS --conf spark.sql.shuffle.partitions=16"
